# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# requirements.in — human-editable dependency constraints (loose).
#
# This is the source of truth. requirements.txt is the PINNED lockfile
# generated from this file and is what every consumer actually installs.
#
# Workflow:
#   1. Edit constraints here.
#   2. Regenerate the lock:
#        pip install pip-tools
#        pip-compile --strip-extras -o requirements.txt requirements.in
#      (or seed requirements.txt from the "Successfully installed ..." line
#       of a green CI run on the Linux runner).
#   3. Commit requirements.in and requirements.txt together.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

